WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.492
The final slide points you toward the official Pandas documentation and examples of how Pandas skills appear in current

00:00:08.492 --> 00:00:12.277
data roles. Documentation should become part of your normal workflow.

00:00:12.277 --> 00:00:21.182
Even experienced analysts look up function options, examples, and edge cases rather than relying only on memory.

00:00:21.182 --> 00:00:25.667
The best next step is to practice on a small real dataset.

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:34.432
Begin with a clear question, inspect the data before changing it, and make every cleaning or transformation step support

00:00:34.432 --> 00:00:38.460
that question. Then validate the result and explain what you learned.

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:46.687
In the next module, we will move beyond the core workflow and explore more advanced Pandas techniques.

00:00:46.687 --> 00:00:51.352
The goal will be to make your data work more expressive, more efficient,

00:00:51.352 --> 00:00:54.955
and easier to reuse in larger analytical projects.
